  "question": {
    "text": "The number of permutations of the alphabets of the word <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">“</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">”</mi></math> in which <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">’</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> are together but <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">’</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> are separated, is"
